+++ b/changelog/5103.feature.rst
@@ -0,0 +1,4 @@
+Improve the assertion failure message for ``all()`` and ``any()`` calls over a
+comprehension by unrolling the iterable.  The report now points at the
+predicate and the element which made the assertion fail, instead of showing an
+unhelpful representation of the generator.
